tooltip_text = "Acceptance Rate:
Percentage of students who get accepted, typically
lower looks better.
Yield Rate:
Out of the students that get accepted, this is the
percentage of students who choose to go here.
Average SAT Score:
This is the average SAT score of a student who
gets accepted (Min: 400, Max: 1600).
Average GPA:
This the average GPA of  a student who gets
accepted (Min: 0.0, Max: 4.0)
New Students:
This is the amount of new students who are
coming to the school.
Cost of Attendance:
This is the amount of money that a student
may have to spend to attend this school.
Average Aid:
This is the amount of money the average
students recieves to attend this school.
Average Value:
This is the average that students are
willing to pay to attend this school."
mouse_filter = 0
